# Conexiones · chunking → data (features 022 y 023): lo que una corrida de producción escribe y lee en el grafo.
# Se ejecutan con la extensión REST Client de VS Code ("Send Request" sobre cada una) o con httpyac.
# Requiere Neo4j. Ejecutar de arriba a abajo: escribe un documento de prueba ("test-conn-*") con la MISMA forma que
# escribe una corrida (Hierarchy.build / Hierarchy.failed), lo lee como lo lee chunking, lo reprocesa y lo borra
# (repetible). En una corrida real los ids son: PIAA = código, JSON = sha256, SECCION = <sha256>:s<n>,
# FRAGMENTOS = <sha256>:<indice>.

@graph = http://127.0.0.1:8000/data

### 1 · guardar un documento fragmentado: PIAA (ensure, solo id) → JSON → SECCION → FRAGMENTOS en una transacción
POST {{graph}}/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "replace_from": {"label": "JSON", "id": "test-conn-sha"},
  "nodes": [
    {"label": "PIAA", "id": "test-conn-piaa", "properties": {}, "mode": "ensure"},
    {"label": "JSON", "id": "test-conn-sha", "mode": "replace", "properties": {
      "origen": "2020/05_Mayo/Semana_01/000815/plan.pdf", "destino": "vigentes/pdf/2020-05_Mayo-Semana_01-000815-plan.pdf",
      "nombre": "plan.pdf", "tipo": "pdf", "anio": 2020, "codigo": "test-conn-piaa", "sha256": "test-conn-sha",
      "fingerprint": "v1", "tokenizador": "sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2", "max_tokens": 512,
      "fusionar_vecinos": true, "repetir_encabezado_tabla": false, "estructura_tablas": true, "modo_tablas": "accurate",
      "docling": "2.134.0", "estado": "fragmentado", "error": null, "fragmentado_en": "2026-10-22T10:00:00-05:00",
      "fragmentos": 2}},
    {"label": "SECCION", "id": "test-conn-sha:s0", "mode": "replace", "properties": {"orden": 0, "encabezados": ["OBJETIVOS"]}},
    {"label": "FRAGMENTOS", "id": "test-conn-sha:0", "mode": "replace", "properties": {"indice": 0, "texto": "Primer chunk", "texto_contextualizado": "OBJETIVOS\nPrimer chunk", "encabezados": ["OBJETIVOS"], "paginas": [1], "tokens": 5}},
    {"label": "FRAGMENTOS", "id": "test-conn-sha:1", "mode": "replace", "properties": {"indice": 1, "texto": "Segundo chunk", "texto_contextualizado": "OBJETIVOS\nSegundo chunk", "encabezados": ["OBJETIVOS"], "paginas": [1, 2], "tokens": 5}}
  ],
  "relationships": [
    {"type": "ES", "source": {"label": "PIAA", "id": "test-conn-piaa"}, "target": {"label": "JSON", "id": "test-conn-sha"}, "properties": {}},
    {"type": "TIENE_SECCION", "source": {"label": "JSON", "id": "test-conn-sha"}, "target": {"label": "SECCION", "id": "test-conn-sha:s0"}, "properties": {}},
    {"type": "TIENE_FRAGMENTO", "source": {"label": "SECCION", "id": "test-conn-sha:s0"}, "target": {"label": "FRAGMENTOS", "id": "test-conn-sha:0"}, "properties": {}},
    {"type": "TIENE_FRAGMENTO", "source": {"label": "SECCION", "id": "test-conn-sha:s0"}, "target": {"label": "FRAGMENTOS", "id": "test-conn-sha:1"}, "properties": {}}
  ]
}

### 2 · lo procesado: chunking compara origen, sha256, fingerprint y estado de cada JSON (paginado de a 500)
GET {{graph}}/nodes/JSON?page=1&per_page=500

### 3 · el documento y lo que le cuelga (así lee chunking las secciones y sus chunks)
GET {{graph}}/nodes/JSON/test-conn-sha/relationships

###
GET {{graph}}/nodes/SECCION/test-conn-sha:s0/relationships

### 4 · reprocesar con otros parámetros: replace_from borra la sección y los chunks viejos; el PIAA queda
POST {{graph}}/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "replace_from": {"label": "JSON", "id": "test-conn-sha"},
  "nodes": [
    {"label": "PIAA", "id": "test-conn-piaa", "properties": {}, "mode": "ensure"},
    {"label": "JSON", "id": "test-conn-sha", "mode": "replace", "properties": {"origen": "2020/05_Mayo/Semana_01/000815/plan.pdf", "sha256": "test-conn-sha", "fingerprint": "v2", "max_tokens": 256, "estado": "fragmentado", "fragmentos": 1}},
    {"label": "SECCION", "id": "test-conn-sha:s0", "mode": "replace", "properties": {"orden": 0, "encabezados": []}},
    {"label": "FRAGMENTOS", "id": "test-conn-sha:0", "mode": "replace", "properties": {"indice": 0, "texto": "Un solo chunk", "paginas": [1, 2], "tokens": 4}}
  ],
  "relationships": [
    {"type": "ES", "source": {"label": "PIAA", "id": "test-conn-piaa"}, "target": {"label": "JSON", "id": "test-conn-sha"}, "properties": {}},
    {"type": "TIENE_SECCION", "source": {"label": "JSON", "id": "test-conn-sha"}, "target": {"label": "SECCION", "id": "test-conn-sha:s0"}, "properties": {}},
    {"type": "TIENE_FRAGMENTO", "source": {"label": "SECCION", "id": "test-conn-sha:s0"}, "target": {"label": "FRAGMENTOS", "id": "test-conn-sha:0"}, "properties": {}}
  ]
}

### 5 · check: el chunk 1 viejo ya no está (404)
GET {{graph}}/nodes/FRAGMENTOS/test-conn-sha:1

### 6 · un documento que falló (Hierarchy.failed): estado "error", su motivo, sin chunks (retry_errors lo reintenta)
POST {{graph}}/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "replace_from": {"label": "JSON", "id": "test-conn-error"},
  "nodes": [{"label": "JSON", "id": "test-conn-error", "mode": "replace", "properties": {"origen": "2020/x/y/000000/roto.pdf", "sha256": "test-conn-error", "fingerprint": "v1", "estado": "error", "error": "ConversionError: PDF protegido", "fragmentos": 0}}],
  "relationships": []
}

### cleanup
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/FRAGMENTOS/test-conn-sha:0

###
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/SECCION/test-conn-sha:s0

###
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/JSON/test-conn-sha

###
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/JSON/test-conn-error

###
DELETE {{graph}}/nodes/PIAA/test-conn-piaa
